{"q":"348","t":"Design Tic-Tac-Toe","d":"Medium","p":true,"c":null,"h":["Could you trade extra space such that <code>move()</code> operation can be done in O(1)?","You need two arrays: int rows[n], int cols[n], plus two variables: diagonal, anti_diagonal."],"m":"{\n  \"classname\": \"TicTacToe\",\n  \"constructor\": {\n    \"params\": [\n      {\n        \"type\": \"integer\",\n        \"name\": \"n\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"methods\": [\n    {\n      \"params\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"integer\",\n          \"name\": \"row\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"integer\",\n          \"name\": \"col\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"integer\",\n          \"name\": \"player\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"name\": \"move\",\n      \"return\": {\n        \"type\": \"integer\"\n      }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"return\": {\n    \"type\": \"boolean\"\n  },\n  \"systemdesign\": true,\n  \"manual\": true\n}","g":[{"name":"Array","slug":"array"},{"name":"Hash Table","slug":"hash-table"},{"name":"Design","slug":"design"},{"name":"Matrix","slug":"matrix"},{"name":"Simulation","slug":"simulation"}]}